Optional XHIBIT Manager - not production-verified

The current Python implementation is retained without changing forms, POST/200
responses, audit identity or database-update semantics. It is disabled and absent
from default release packages. Enable only through an approved --with-manager
package/configuration/preflight, preserving existing Apache authentication and
access restrictions. CDU.url updates do not update urlMappings.url.
See ../migration/README.md. Absence from Model Court is not evidence of parity.
